OL,3,AMaya Jama steps down as host of reality
OL,4,ATV show Love Island
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresenter Maya Jama has announced she
OL,7,Fis stepping down as the host of reality
OL,8,FTV show Love Island after three years.
OL,10,FThe 32-year-old wrote on Instagram
OL,11,Falongside a highlights reel of her on
OL,12,Fthe programme that it was "time to
OL,13,Fthrow myself into something new".
OL,15,F"While my own Love Island journey has
OL,16,Fcome to an end, I wish the show and the
OL,17,Fteam all the success in the world, I'll
OL,18,Fbe cheering you lot on from the
OL,19,Fsidelines forever," the TV and radio
OL,20,Fpresenter said.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
